From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 22:05:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Hold retained caches weakly and keep them in step

Hold cached svg trees weakly: the source-keyed cache kept every parsed tree alive
until 512 entries flushed it, so hold the trees weakly and drop dead keys on insert.
Live use sites still share one tree.

Keep shadow ids out of the id map across mutations: only register ids for elements
connected to the document tree, and remove them when a subtree leaves it, so moving,
cloning or re-inserting a shadow-tree element cannot make getElementById return a node
from a shadow tree.
---
 src/mutator.rs | 51 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 src/util.rs    | 46 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 2 files changed, 89 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

